  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/658/658-21.htm",
  "statuteText": "658:21 Supervisor Pro Tem. –\n\nIf more than one member of the board of supervisors is absent from any state election or is unable to perform his duties, a supervisor pro tempore shall be appointed by the moderator."
